WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:08.174 position:56%
The electricity challenge in Nigeria

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:11.302
and even in broad
Africa is insanely huge.

00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:17.100
We have more than 100
million Nigerians living

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.477
in one form of energy
poverty or the other.

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:23.481 position:59%
We have more than 600 million Africans

00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:25.108
who have no access to electricity.

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:28.570
Our goal is simple.
To provide electricity

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:31.781 position:66%
to people that don't have access to power.

00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:37.537
How can we build a system
that could allow people

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:41.249 position:56%
to access power quickly, efficiently

00:00:41.249 --> 00:00:43.334
and more importantly, affordably?

00:00:50.508 --> 00:00:54.846
My name is Olugbenga Olubanjo
and I'm the CEO of Reeddi.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:01:02.353
Reeddi is a climate care
company that provides clean,

00:01:02.353 --> 00:01:06.274
reliable and affordable
electricity to communities.

00:01:07.817 --> 00:01:10.570
The average person on
the street is able to

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:14.449
access electricity when they
need it, anytime and anywhere.

00:01:14.449 --> 00:01:16.576
So the thinking was that
it has to be mobile enough

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:18.745
that people should be
able to move it around

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:21.206 position:66%
but simple enough that anybody can use it.

00:01:21.206 --> 00:01:23.625 position:58%
And flexible enough that it can power

00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:26.044 position:58%
different devices at different times.

00:01:34.469 --> 00:01:35.887
I was a curious kid,

00:01:35.887 --> 00:01:38.431
I always wanted to be excellent,

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:41.601
so I'm always striving for
the best in everything.

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:44.062 position:64%
My Mum is a teacher and my Dad has an MBA

00:01:44.062 --> 00:01:45.897 position:61%
so everybody just have to go to school.

00:01:45.897 --> 00:01:50.235 position:73%
They have like, all this educational background
and they kind of value education a lot.

00:01:53.029 --> 00:01:55.782
When I got to Toronto,
the different experience

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:57.826
was that there's power everywhere.

00:01:57.826 --> 00:02:03.248
It was like... I was just
amazed at how I could

00:02:03.248 --> 00:02:04.666
I could get stuff done.

00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:06.459 position:56%
Basically, I just get more optimized

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:08.378
because you can actually
do anything at any time.

00:02:08.378 --> 00:02:11.131
I don't need to worry
about power and I could see

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:12.924
my productivity quadruple.

00:02:18.805 --> 00:02:22.016
I still have friends who still
struggle with power until now

00:02:22.016 --> 00:02:23.685
I still have like,
I have family members

00:02:23.685 --> 00:02:24.811
who struggle with power.

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:28.815
I feel I'm obliged to do
something in that regard

00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:30.650
given my experience.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:33.153
So I was thinking through
what's gonna be the best way to

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:34.445
solve the problem

00:02:34.445 --> 00:02:37.448
in the most affordable way,
and the most efficient way.

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:42.829
I need to build a system that is
affordable, that is mobile

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:46.374 position:63%
and also that does both AC and DC power.

00:02:46.374 --> 00:02:47.500
I must think differently,

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.836 position:64%
and I must obviously operate differently.

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:51.462 position:66%
So for us at Reeddi, what we had to do was

00:02:51.462 --> 00:02:54.757 position:61%
to innovate on the business model side,

00:02:54.757 --> 00:02:56.676
while also innovating
on the technology side.

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:58.261 position:64%
So on the technology build Reeddi capsule

00:02:58.261 --> 00:03:01.264
on the business model,
provide the Reeddi capsule

00:03:01.264 --> 00:03:04.017
leveraging a rental model
that allows the average

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:05.602 position:56%
