00:03:05.602 --> 00:03:09.147
Basically eliminating
the upfront cost barrier

00:03:09.147 --> 00:03:11.858
that's associated
with accessing clean,

00:03:11.858 --> 00:03:13.651 position:56%
reliable and affordable electricity.

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:21.826
So like, the design was
done by one of my friends,

00:03:21.826 --> 00:03:23.661
the engineering was done
by one of my friends,

00:03:23.661 --> 00:03:24.996 position:58%
and they were just, were just scrappy

00:03:24.996 --> 00:03:26.456
just trying to get something.

00:03:26.456 --> 00:03:28.833
And when they got it done
for me, I was in Toronto

00:03:28.833 --> 00:03:30.084 position:59%
