laid all the foundation to

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:51.064
make it work.

00:03:53.858 --> 00:03:56.861 position:63%
Reeddi's approach to solving the problem

00:03:56.861 --> 00:03:59.030 position:58%
of the electricity sector in Nigeria,

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:01.157
is to provide electricity

00:04:01.157 --> 00:04:04.160
to people, irrespective of
socioeconomic background.

00:04:12.877 --> 00:04:14.587
We observe that the
critical challenge is the

00:04:14.587 --> 00:04:17.882
financing part where
people need to pay a very

00:04:17.882 --> 00:04:21.427
expensive upfront cost to
even access the system.

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:25.223
Our goal is to eliminate
that upfront cost entirely

00:04:25.223 --> 00:04:28.017
by using the rent-to-use
model that we have.

00:04:28.017 --> 00:04:31.229
So customers just go to
the Reeddi Ambassadors

00:04:31.229 --> 00:04:33.189
and rent the cost of
the Reeddi Ambassadors.

00:04:33.189 --> 00:04:36.401
The Reeddi Ambassadors take
the Reeddi capsule from

00:04:36.401 --> 00:04:39.362
the Reeddi charge station,
and this Ambassador

00:04:39.362 --> 00:04:41.406 position:64%
even increase their own quality of labor,

00:04:41.406 --> 00:04:42.657
because they make money by renting,

00:04:42.657 --> 00:04:44.701
by becoming a Reeddi Ambassadors

00:04:44.701 --> 00:04:47.078 position:59%
because they rent the Reeddi capsules.

00:04:47.078 --> 00:04:48.788 position:56%
And they're not bonded by contracts.

00:04:48.788 --> 00:04:50.790 position:66%
Because what we observe was that the other

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.625
the most of the existing companies

00:04:52.625 --> 00:04:54.127
they have to bind you by contract

00:04:54.127 --> 00:04:55.795
